run: T22, prespecified rerun of the 15 bootstrap cells after T21 (common random numbers, 10 x n_sim point estimate)
written: 2026-10-14, before the full array was run (one pilot task, below)
package_commit: 41d71de (feature/crn; control-variate centering)
pilot: job 4337060 task 720 (boot-5-N1000, reps 1901-2000) at 4bba493 covered 0.79 with uncentered CRN; design fixed before the full array. Pilot output discarded, not collated.
cells: boot-1..5 x N in {50, 250, 1000}; worker main-mode tasks 421-720 (20 chunks x 100 reps per cell)
replications: 2000 per cell
base_seed: 20261015 (CALIB_BASE_SEED); stream rule otherwise identical to calib_manifest.dcf
controls: n_boot 1000, n_sim 10000 (point estimate uses 10 x n_sim inside the package)
decision_rule: unchanged and frozen (calib_collate.R): exact 95% binomial CI over all attempted reps; PASS inside [0.93, 0.97], FAIL wholly outside, else INCONCLUSIVE
collate: CALIB_FAMILY=boot Rscript inst/sim/calibration/calib_collate.R <parts> <out>
